Ewif-8q4xNKWAxVpla8BHXdoBdEQ3YcHCHsoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwif-8q4xNKWAxVpla8BHXdoBdEQ3IcHCHooDw",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwif-8q4xNKWAxVpla8BHXdoBdEQ3IcHCHwoEA",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwif-8q4xNKWAxVpla8BHXdoBdEQ3IcHCH0oEQ",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwif-8q4xNKWAxVpla8BHXdoBdEQ3IcHCH4oEg",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這次去麵匡匡拉麵食堂，選了他們的招牌豚骨拉麵，整體來說，這家店的拉麵風格比較清爽，不像日本傳統的豚骨拉麵那麼濃厚重鹹，適合喜歡喝湯的人。\n\n🍜 拉麵口感\n我這次選的是粗麵，但吃起來有點偏硬，可能是店家本身的設定比較有嚼勁。如果下次再來，我會選軟一點的口感，應該會更合適。湯頭是清爽型的豚骨湯，喝起來不膩口，適合台灣人的口味，但如果習慣日本那種濃郁系豚骨湯的人，可能會覺得味道稍微淡了一些。\n\n🥩 配料與小菜\n叉燒肉表現不錯，帶有油脂但不會太膩，肉質軟嫩入味。招牌唐揚雞外酥內嫩，炸得剛剛好，不會覺得油膩。糖心蛋也很好吃，蛋黃的熟度剛好，濃郁帶點微流心的口感。比較特別的是節瓜和玉米筍，這兩樣配菜吃起來很清爽，搭配拉麵剛好解膩，算是蠻用心的搭配。\n\n💡 總結感想\n麵匡匡的豚骨拉麵走的是比較清爽的風格，適合喜歡喝湯、但不愛過重鹹口味的人。麵條的軟硬度可以再調整，配菜和炸物表現都蠻不錯，整體來說是一家值得嘗試的拉麵店。如果下次再訪，我會試試不同的麵條軟硬度，看看是不是更合口味！",null,[0,76]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2933632298245873532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTkplbTlZVkZsQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2933632298245873532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTkplbTlZVkZsQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2933632298245873532/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTkplbTlZVkZsQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2933632298245873532/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTkplbTlZVkZsQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2933632298245873532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTkplbTlZVkZsQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2933632298245873532/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTkplbTlZVkZsQkVB